OL,3,AAuthor Helen Fielding launches award to
OL,4,Afind the next Bridget Jones's Diary
OL,5,
OL,6,FBridget Jones author Helen Fielding has
OL,7,Flaunched a new prize aimed at
OL,8,Fdiscovering funny diary writers from
OL,9,Fthe north of England, saying
OL,10,Fopportunities across the UK are "very
OL,11,Funeven".
OL,13,FWest Yorkshire-born Fielding, who
OL,14,Fpenned Bridget's famous diary as well
OL,15,Fco-writing the film adaptations, has
OL,16,Fset up the Bridget Jones Prize with
OL,17,Fcharity New Writing North.
OL,19,FThe award will go to the person who
OL,20,Fsubmits the funniest 1,000-word piece
OL,21,Fof first-person writing.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
